   "title_pl": "Podatek Belki od sprzedaży (PIT-38)",
   "status": "tested",
   "says": "Gains realised in the year on a holding (FIFO per account), less its losses, taxed at 19%, paid with PIT-38 by 30 April.",
   "sources": [
    "ustawa o PIT art. 30b ust. 1, art. 24 ust. 10 (FIFO odrębnie dla każdego rachunku), art. 45 ust. 1"
